id=axion_recents
name=Axion Recents (Stacked Overview)
version=v1.2
versionCode=3
author=L3FeL
description=Stacked (deck-style) recents for Motorola Android 16. Boot-time tmpfs mirror of an AxionOS/Lawnchair-derived Launcher3 plus a static framework RRO that points config_recentsComponentName at it. Two modes, no flag files: Axion as desktop + recents (default), or C-lite - the stock Moto launcher keeps HOME while Axion still serves the recents, which you switch on by enabling the bundled LSPosed bridge in LSPosed and rebooting (the module installs that APK by itself; see extras/C-LITE.md). Automatic HOME handover, crash-loop watchdog, one-toggle rollback.
